            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Now 2.10.11

- Moved the volume popover onto macOS’s actual AppKit Liquid Glass surface on macOS 26 and later.
- Tuned the native volume slider to the slimmer system-HUD control size while retaining the fast reveal and return animation.
]]></description>
